# RackNerd VPS 状态定时查询 (Quantumult X Snippet)
# Author: fishyo
# Homepage: https://github.com/fishyo/someLoonThings
# Icon: https://fastly.jsdelivr.net/gh/fishyo/someLoonThings@main/icons/racknerd.png
#
# 【参数配置说明】：
# 本脚本完全依托 BoxJS 进行参数管理与配置：
# 1. 订阅 BoxJS 地址：https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fishyo/someLoonThings/main/script/boxjs.json
# 2. 在 BoxJS 应用列表中找到“RackNerd 状态”，填入 API Key 与 API Hash 即可。
# ==============================================================================

[task_local]
# 每天 06:01 定时查询 RackNerd VPS 流量与运行状态
1 6 * * * https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fishyo/someLoonThings/main/script/racknerd/racknerd.js, tag=RackNerd VPS 状态, img-url=https://fastly.jsdelivr.net/gh/fishyo/someLoonThings@main/icons/racknerd.png, enabled=true
